{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act15side_level_act15side_03_end",
  "groupId": "act15side",
  "stageId": "act15side_03",
  "title": "光與影",
  "storyCode": "IW-3",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "72cf17950f8dde14248b39d6ddcb6babd30c89c4c0e6927f7a940c72f5bb2a34",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "3下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "晌午，晴，彷彿前一日的風雨欲來只是個不痛不癢的玩笑。\n尚蜀三山十七峰，第二高山，是居奇山。而居奇山只有二峰，其中第二高的峰，即是泥泥峰。\n泥泥峰又有二千二百二十二級台階，本來沒這麼湊巧，是為了取個噱頭，後來特地加算進去的。\n臺階向天，穿雲踱霧。愈往高處，遊客越少，人蹤漸薄，徒留青山。\n而零星可見的身影，一眼望去，皆是挑夫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館歇腳人",
      "text": "雖然比不得天嶽，可當真是一座高峰啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館歇腳人",
      "text": "你說這些修不得公路的半山腰上，是怎麼建起一家家茶館涼亭的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館觀光客",
      "text": "唉，能怎麼建，靠人力囉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館觀光客",
      "text": "咱們上來的時候，不是看見一個挑夫走下山去嘛？他們每天就這一趟趟的，小到乾糧茶水，大到石磚青瓦，不都是挑上來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館觀光客",
      "text": "聽說他們一趟路要爬個好些時辰，辛苦得很。就算到了今天，有些偏僻山頭啊，還是離不開挑夫......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館歇腳人",
      "text": "就不能拉個索道，或者起個吊車之類的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館觀光客",
      "text": "那也得先有個施工的地方吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館歇腳人",
      "text": "也對，不過我也不太明白這是怎麼弄的......不過他們還真了不起啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館歇腳人",
      "text": "他們應該賺挺多吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館觀光客",
      "text": "以前不多，不過前段時間看新聞說，尚蜀知府非常重視這些賣力氣的，甚至這些茶館的茶水都是政府掏錢免費提供的......呃？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......抱歉，讓讓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "晌午茶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "text": "好的，尚師傅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "text": "最近怎麼樣？有幾天沒見著你了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "不怎麼樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "text": "做什麼去了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "看望我兒子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "text": "啊......又到了這個時候啦......我都忙忘了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "text": "尚師傅早點打聲招呼，我們可以陪著去的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......算了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "他喜歡清靜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "text": "唉，都過去好多年啦......我是和你熟悉，才和你說這些話，你別介意啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "text": "人總是要向前看的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......你在替鄭清鉞說話？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "text": "廢話，我們這家店都是鄭掌櫃投資的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "拿人錢，替人說話，那我就不怨你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "text": "也有一半是真心話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......那我怨你一半。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "text": "這麼多年了，多勸你一句不多，少勸你一句不少。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館夥計",
      "text": "好好喝茶，好好想想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館歇腳人",
      "text": "......我們剛才在山路上，是不是看見過那人下山？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館觀光客",
      "text": "是、是啊？這才多久？爬回來了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茶館觀光客",
      "text": "應該是路上遇到同事，接了個力吧......不然這才半個時辰，就從半山腰到這兒走了個來回？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......不行，聯繫不上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "通訊沒有反應，就說明年和夕還不在尚蜀地界......也可能他們根本沒有按照行動守則行動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "......恩人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "嗯，我知道你要說什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "雖然我不是什麼過目不忘的聰明人，可我要是沒看錯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "鯉先生交給梁先生的那個匣子，和那位年小姐當時手裡的東西，是一個圖樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "果然和她們倆的突然離隊有關。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "恩人，我們怎麼辦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "嗯......其實我也不是沒有預料到這個情況。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "我和小炎熔說好啦，等她到了辦事處，立刻聯絡尚蜀附近的幹員來接我們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "呃？原來恩人早有準備？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "我就猜到年一路上鬼鬼祟祟的，準沒好事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "那意思是，我們果然還是先留在這裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "既然這麼巧遇上了鯉先生，自然是要幫忙的。合約上是這麼寫的嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "原來如此，恩人秉公辦事，兢兢業業，令人欽佩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......可畢竟鯉先生是個聰明人。客棧偶遇之後，他一直沒開口請求羅德島的協助，也許本來就是在暗示我們不必摻和此事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "但如果事情真的和年有關......再加上那個太合和左樂說的話......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "總之，到時先去約定好的地點瞧瞧。雖然我想年多半不會守約，但夕不是那樣的人。說不定能見她一面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "說的是，夕小姐應該會透露一些線索吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "不管怎麼想，有些事情也實在是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "——實在是太巧了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "小烏有，你選那家客棧落腳，總不能是別有用心吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "恩人說笑了，就算我別有用心，我也沒能耐指使鉗獸掀了我的車，再恰巧撞上恩人啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "那究竟是誰，能讓這件事巧得不能再巧了呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "text": "......恩人，您剛才應該是開玩笑的吧，是開玩笑的吧？不是真懷疑我吧？恩人！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "爹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "......怎麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "這件事不是應該全部交給我負責嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "總得有人收拾爛攤子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "爹能做到的，我分明也能——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "錯了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "你就算能，也不能。只要你還是杜遙夜，不是杜鏢頭，就絕對不行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "為什麼！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "爹為什麼在客棧時沒有甕中捉鼈，還特地制止你？你難道猜不到？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "是那個身手了得的卡特斯，和那個叫烏有的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "那看來你還沒到火候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "......什麼火候？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "識人的火候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "爹！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "您究竟是想讓我繼承您的位置，還是想讓我一輩子當那個不諳世事的杜大小姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "......鏢師多結仇。你不明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "所以我要當那個紈絝可笑、不明事理的大小姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "我要讓所有人相信，那個鄭大鏢頭已經是個踏踏實實做生意的老頭子，而我，不過是扶不上牆的繼承人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "可那終歸不是我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "......夜兒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "您知道現在鏢局年輕人對您有多大意見嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "他們懂什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "......您又懂什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "火急火燎想當甩手掌櫃，卻看不到多少年輕一輩早就對鏢局現狀怨聲載道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "......那你憑良心告訴爹，和那群不成器的徒弟一起自立門戶，就是你真正想做的事情了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "現在這個你，就是你了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "我只知道，這件事，爹是讓我辦的。辦成了，就能服眾，還能做成一件大事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "我怕你做不好這件事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "更怕你存心做不好這件事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "......我不懂爹在說什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "那如果爹您改了主意，請趕緊告訴我，如果沒有，那麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "就請您別管我的事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "text": "......杜小姐，情況怎麼樣？掌櫃的怎麼說？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "哼，能怎麼樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "鄭老頭讓人給耍了，那夥人早早做好了調包。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "text": "我看用不著我們故意把事情搞砸，掌櫃的自己就能玩砸了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "......我看未必。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "他意識到我們的想法了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "text": "啊、啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "街頭青年",
      "text": "他知道了？那怎麼辦？師傅們要是罰我們禁足，不就什麼都做不了了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜小姐",
      "text": "......要迅速解決問題，很麻煩。可要是迅速製造問題，總是不難的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "早年遊覽尚蜀就感歎過一番，尚蜀百姓實在是有本事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "從新巒區到流雲區，需要繞過多少座奇峰險峻？城區分散在山巒之中，煙火更是遍佈山間，奇景奇景，妙哉妙哉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "......先前搶你物件的那件事，你弄明白了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "我也不傻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "只是我相信梁洵，所以信得過慎師傅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "唉，你算活成人精了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "梁洵是這麼說我的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "是我自己以為的。怎麼會想到梁大人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "他以前說過我，說我裝模作樣，算天天不準，測地地不靈，唯獨誰都說叵測的人心，我每一次都能矇得準。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "這就叫活成人精了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......經驗罷了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "接著走吧。這座昏譚峰就這麼點大，一路走來，確實沒見著過什麼亭子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "取江峰不遠，可為什麼要選那座山頭？要找人，直接去人家最多的地方不好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "取江峰以前叫什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "攥江峰。名字難寫難記，後來要開發成景區，就改名了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "那就是了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "我做了一個怪夢，夢裡，我在那山峰頂上尋人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "......還有這種神奇的事？是鯉小子你以前來尚蜀的時候聽說過這個古名？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "也許吧......或者說......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": ".....說不定是有仙人指路呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "......你會用法術吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "現在是叫源石技藝了？文縐縐的名字，這類東西，擱在很久以前，不就和神仙鬼怪差不多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "這就不對了，慎師傅。符籙為人驅使，乃人定勝天之道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉？",
      "text": "人定勝天之道？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉？",
      "text": "我喜歡這句話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "好吧，源石技藝，源石技藝，真是不太懂現在這些源石研究的門道......嗯？幹嘛愣在原地？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "剛才......我說了什麼嗎......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "人定勝天？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......不......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......沒什麼，當我發白日夢了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......取江峰，攥江峰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "我們分明幾次探尋，可還是毫無線索。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "......理所當然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "司歲台還是下定了決心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "可她......在尚蜀的她，真在歷史上有過什麼大是大非嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "她當年又為何願意為大炎出力，參軍戍邊數十載？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "歲月悠悠，絕非常理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "可眼下之事似乎事與願違，梁先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......如果她是影子，那從龍門帶來的酒盞，就是火光了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "呵......先有光還是先有影，真是個無意義的難題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "難在解題人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "司歲台親自找我，曉之以理動之以情，我當然明白輕重。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "你本答應左將軍，酒盞抵達尚蜀後，便佯裝遭劫，送與左公子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......以此瞞過某些人的眼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "可我總不能一五一十地告訴老鯉他一個外人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "那你就不該選那個龍門人來替你做這件事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "只是礙於身份，不可貿然行事，萬一影響尚蜀的早春煙火，得不償失。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "既然我在尚蜀為官，一磚一瓦，都是大事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "可那個龍門人不是你的朋友嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "是我的朋友。但也是外人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "......人多眼雜，不怨梁先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "酒盞如今？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "既要托我那友人，酒盞自然在他的身上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "梁大人打算假手於人，讓那龍門人找出令之所在？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "傳言那盞能附靈於周遭器物，當真無事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......太合先生，我也有一事相問。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "請說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "你我放下官階立場，平心而論。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "這次司歲台可是繞過禮部，激進行事，大有越俎代庖之嫌。事後禮部反應過來，免不了一番唇槍舌劍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "你既是肅政院副監察御史，對此作何想？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "將軍於我有恩，太合知恩圖報而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......那就是私情了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "不錯，私情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "肅政院監察御史，體察百官，肅整朝儀，似乎與私情這個詞，相去甚遠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "那若是肅政院得知此事詳情後，覺得禮部才合情理，司歲台大錯特錯，私情又怎麼辦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "取忠捨義。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "嗯......太合先生回答得很果斷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "當然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "教我這四個字的，正是將軍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......大丈夫，當如是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "不過梁先生大可不必擔憂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "左將軍既然是大炎軍人，絕不會擅行有違律法之事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......是有人讓司歲台如此作為？哪怕越過禮部那些人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "也對......誰能讓平祟侯左宣遼不去勞心邊疆事務，特地來操勞這區區一件酒盞？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "說小不小，說大不大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "至於是誰，心知肚明便是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......嘶......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "梁先生保重身體。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......今年尚蜀的早春，還是比預想的冷些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "取江峰周邊，除了一些散戶，就這一個鎮子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......這是個怎麼樣的地方？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "早在尚蜀城市尚未建立的時候，這裡臨近邊疆，山脈礦藏豐富，有許多鐵匠和雕石匠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "現在呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "......世道太平，移動城市也開進了群山之中，除了被當作景點保留下來的一些大鍛爐，剩下的都成了民宿了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "慎師傅，那這取江峰上......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "......這就沒印象了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "唔......也許只是個觀棋飲酒的去處？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "畢竟若是什麼名勝之地，那也輪不到我來找了，多半還得是那種地處偏僻、無人問津的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "......尚蜀山水我也算熟稔得很了，還從未聽說過取江峰有什麼無人問津的亭子的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "取江峰的山頂，只有偌大一片空地。傳說有神人在此悟得臨淵忘水之道，所以人稱“忘水坪”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......是嗎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "那這找人的活兒，可難辦多了......不如從酒鋪下手？可梁洵又說不知道那人模樣，問了也白問......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "慎師傅，有何高見？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "找人嘛，自古以來都只有一個方法最簡單。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "就是讓那個人來找你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "有道理，可惜這道理有些缺乏能動性。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "不過我倒是有個想法——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......怎麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "有事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......寧小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "梁大人有雅興，這時候還看閒書。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "閒書總是多多益善的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "寧小姐有話便說就是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "梁大人最近，是不是遇上了什麼麻煩？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "唔......寧小姐是指？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "你的那位龍門朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......是有些麻煩事，瞞不過寧小姐的眼，私事罷了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "關於什麼的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "找人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "唔......找什麼人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "一位我與他的故友，是個武林中人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "......只是個武林中人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "姓槐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "就這件小事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "我一早就說了，是一件......小事，不勞寧小姐費心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "梁大人可不該瞞我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "我有什麼好瞞你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "......好吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "眼前的女子在房間踱步，掃視書架，彷彿有一種失落的情緒籠罩四周。\n所幸很快，她又提起了興致。\n她的情緒總是這般變化很快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "......梁大人手裡那本閒書，是本歷史傳記？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......說的是過去在這尚蜀三山地界，發生的一場天災。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "梁大人很喜歡那段歷史。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "親眼所見，終生難忘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "我記得是叫......《三山談》？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "寧小姐倒是記得清楚，看來我翻這些書，次數有些多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "......偶然留意而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "有空把它借我一閱吧，我好在一會拜訪白叔叔的時候，打發打發時間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "請便。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "好......不過......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "......啊，抱歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "我來取吧，因為近日看得少，放在高處了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "嗯，謝謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "寧小姐一會就要去白陶工那兒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "text": "那還請寧小姐替我向他問好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "......好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "那我先去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "......《三山談》。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "梁大人也不會想到，其實那次你熬夜伏案，睡著在書房，我已經偷偷翻過這些閒書打發時間了吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "（這本書......本來不放在那上面的。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寧小姐",
      "text": "（那麼原本書架上多出的那個盒子......裝的又是什麼呢？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
